sheet.description:
Anyone within {{aura of deescalation:range}}ft of you gains the following benefits: 
			It reduces any damage taken by {{aura of deescalation:damage reduction}} if it has not dealt damage since the start of its last turn; 
			It can gain advantage on any social interaction as an action; 
			It is stabilized instead of dying when reduced to 0 HP, unless the attacker explicitly declares lethal intent.
